WEBVTT

00:00:29.109 --> 00:00:30.839
service to people,

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.237
democracy

00:00:32.261 --> 00:00:35.847
and fixing the problems
that community members face.

00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:38.197
Seventeen years ago,

00:00:38.221 --> 00:00:42.233
I walked through city hall
for the first time as a staff member.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.002
And that walk revealed something to me.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.598
I was a unicorn.

00:00:47.622 --> 00:00:50.109
There weren't many people
who looked like me

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.482
that worked in the building.

00:00:51.871 --> 00:00:55.899
And yet, there were folks committed
to addressing hundreds of years

00:00:55.923 --> 00:00:57.639
of systemic inequity

00:00:57.663 --> 00:01:00.987
that left some behind and many ignored.